  "releaseNotes": "[Add] IAssembler.Synchronize overload taking the identifiers of deleted elements; an element that a DTO no longer lists as owned is detached, not deleted (#427)\n          [Add] ElementContainmentExtensions.UpdateContainment brings the owned relationships, owned related elements and owner of a POCO in line with its DTO (#427)\n          [Update] ToDto takes an optional ILogger and, when derived properties are included, maps each of them independently, leaving an unsupported derivation at its default value with a logged warning instead of throwing (#455)\n          [Update] ToDto maps the members that a subclass redefines with a derived property, such as Membership.MemberElement and Relationship.Source and Target, only when derived properties are included (#455)\n          [Fix] ToDto and FromDto copy value lists such as AliasIds instead of sharing them between the POCO and the DTO (#428)\n          [Fix] The SQL schema makes a column nullable and drops its default when a subclass redefines its property with a derived one, so OwningMembership and ReferenceSubsetting rows can be inserted (#453)",
